{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1164254-who-s-reading-the-pentex-employee-indoctrination-handbook","id":1164254,"title":"Who's reading the Pentex Employee Indoctrination Handbook?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-01T07:19:06-08:00","id":1164254,"title":"Who's reading the Pentex Employee Indoctrination Handbook?","content":"I just got done with it today and really enjoyed it! It's variable in quality (to my eyes anyway) as I loved the Pentex, Lycanthropes, Endron and Magadon chapters, but didn't really get RED, Sunburst or Tellus. One thing it did do was make me laugh <b>a lot</b> but the real horror was to be found in the Magadon chapter.<br /> <br /> I think as a sourcebook and artifact it's a winner. There's loads of plot hooks in there and it's an enjoyable read from cover to cover, which can't be said for every roleplaying sourcebook around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3241-stannis","name":"Stannis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3241_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T08:57:34-08:00","id":1164292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stannis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1164254-who-s-reading-the-pentex-employee-indoctrination-handbook#post1164254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just got done with it today and really enjoyed it! It's variable in quality (to my eyes anyway) as I loved the Pentex, Lycanthropes, Endron and Magadon chapters, but didn't really get RED, Sunburst or Tellus. One thing it did do was make me laugh <b>a lot</b> but the real horror was to be found in the Magadon chapter.<br /> <br /> I think as a sourcebook and artifact it's a winner. There's loads of plot hooks in there and it's an enjoyable read from cover to cover, which can't be said for every roleplaying sourcebook around.</div> </div> </div> </div>Warning: Reading Magadon chapter may cause anaphylaxis in the presence of canines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T15:12:36-08:00","id":1164406,"title":"","content":"I liked it, but was expecting a bit more, I guess?<br /> <br /> I don't know. It was all a bit underwhelming to me, especially for something that has been in the works for years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https: